{"title":"The 60+ Best Black Friday Accessory Deals on iPhone Chargers, TVs, Headphones, and More","link":"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/27/60-best-black-friday-accessory-deals/","date":1795795581000,"content":"Black Friday is over, but we're still tracking great discounts on Apple-related accessories today. If you're looking for Apple products, our dedicated post on <a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/26/50-best-apple-black-friday-deals/\">all the Apple Black Friday deals available now</a> covers every Apple device on sale right now. In this article, we're focusing on accessories for smartphones and computers, as well as a few extras like video games and more.\r<br />\n\r<br />\n<img src=\"/media/6800e784cb12d097c2397a70e9458c0d7e16cf0bb6c5fa41f498cb1d2048ba23.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1406\" /><em><small>Note: MacRumors is an affiliate partner with some of these vendors. When you click a link and make a purchase, we may receive a small payment, which helps us keep the site running.</small></em>\r<br />\n\r<br />\nMany of the deals shared below will be found on Amazon, but there are a few other notable sales at sites like Sonos, Sony, Samsung, and others that you'll find in our lists.\r<br />\n\r<br />\n\r<br />\n<h2>Anker</h2>\r<br />\n<img src=\"/media/01718b5f6ed6f950bad239afa7b881d44efe0fa2e7252e1ab028ae08c3fe2ce3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1406\" />\r<br />\n\r<br />\nAnker's big <a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=43469&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anker.com%2Fblack-friday-sale\">Black Friday sale</a> is here, with many discounts <a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fstores%2Fpage%2F91887AA2-8C06-45A1-9EF9-22CFA1842218%3Fingress%3D2%26lp_context_asin%3DB0F9L265KF%26visitId%3Db66ed8b9-bcfc-4be4-94f6-725cb683f551%26store_ref%3Dbl_ast_dp_brandlogo_sto%26ref_%3Dast_bln\">being matched (or beaten) at Amazon</a>. Anker's SOLIX brand also has <a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=53552&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ankersolix.com%2Fblack-friday-pps%3Fref%3Dhome_banner\">major savings on portable power stations</a>, with up to 54 percent off select accessories.\r<br />\n\r<br />\nAmazon has one of the highlights of this event, with the new Anker Prime 3-in-1 Wireless Charging Station on sale for <a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB0F9L265KF%3FplpRedirect%3DmhFallback%26ref%3Dclp_hp_h_pc%26th%3D1\"><strong>$128.24</strong></a>, down from $229.99. There's also the Anker Prime 3-in-1 Foldable Wireless Charger for <a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-Compatible-Certified-Palm-Sized-Non-Battery%2Fdp%2FB0FHWK3W1S%3Fref_%3Dast_bl_cpl_dp%26th%3D1\"><strong>$94.74</strong></a>, down from $149.99. Both of these are MagSafe-compatible chargers, and these prices are matching the previous Amazon all-time lows.\r<br />\n\r<br />\n<div><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2Fdp%2FB0F9L265KF%3FplpRedirect%3DmhFallback%26ref%3Dclp_hp_h_pc%26th%3D1\" target=\"_blank\"><div><div>$101 OFF</div>Anker Prime 3-in-1 Charging Stand for $128.24</div></a></div>\r<br />\n<div><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-Compatible-Certified-Palm-Sized-Non-Battery%2Fdp%2FB0FHWK3W1S%3Fref_%3Dast_bl_cpl_dp%26th%3D1\" target=\"_blank\"><div><div>$55 OFF</div>Anker Prime 3-in-1 Foldable Charger for $94.74</div></a></div>\r<br />\n\r<br />\nAmazon also has the new MagGo 2 Magnetic Power Banks on sale for <a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-10000mAh-Magnetic-Portable-MagSafe-Compatible%2Fdp%2FB0H695SJZD%2Fref%3Dast_sto_dp_puis%3Fth%3D1\"><strong>$85.99</strong></a>, down from $109.99. These are color matched to go with the new iPhone 18 Pro models, and feature a 10,000 mAh battery.\r<br />\n\r<br />\n<div><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-10000mAh-Magnetic-Portable-MagSafe-Compatible%2Fdp%2FB0H695SJZD%2Fref%3Dast_sto_dp_puis%3Fth%3D1\" target=\"_blank\"><div><div>$24 OFF</div>Anker MagGo 2 Magnetic Power Bank for $85.99</div></a></div>\r<br />\n\r<br />\n<h3>Anker on Amazon</h3>\r<br />\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-Display-Charger-Recognition-Support%2Fdp%2FB0HFS422TJ%2Fref%3Dast_sto_dp_puis%3Fth%3D1\">Nano Smart Display Charger</a> - $25.99, down from $34.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-Compatible-Wireless-Charging-Certified%2Fdp%2FB0D3PN1SFG%3Fref_%3Dast_bl_cpl_dp%26th%3D1\">MagGo 2-in-1 Wireless Charging Stand</a> - $41.99, down from $69.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-Compatible-Wireless-Certified-Foldable%2Fdp%2FB0D8PTGKSM%3Fref_%3Dast_bl_cpl_dp%26th%3D1\">MagGo UFO 3-in-1 Foldable Charger</a> - $59.99, down from $89.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FCompatible-Anker-Charging-Certified-Wireless%2Fdp%2FB0CF56WHV4%3Fref_%3Dast_bl_cpl_dp%26th%3D1\">MagGo 3-in-1 Foldable Charging Station</a> - $65.99, down from $109.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-Display-Docking-displays-Ethernet%2Fdp%2FB0H36FV12Q%2Fref%3Dast_sto_dp_puis%3Fth%3D1\">USB-C Smart Display Hub</a> - $74.99, down from $99.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-10000mAh-Magnetic-Portable-MagSafe-Compatible%2Fdp%2FB0H695SJZD%2Fref%3Dast_sto_dp_puis%3Fth%3D1\">Mago GO 2 Pro Magnetic Power Bank</a> - $85.99, down from $109.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-MagStand-Charging-Personalization-Wireless%2Fdp%2FB0HKRZ881X%2Fref%3Dast_sto_dp_puis%3Fth%3D1\">MagStand Charging Station</a> - $89.99, down from $115.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://buy.geni.us/Proxy.ashx?TSID=3088&amp;GR_URL=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.com%2FAnker-Prime-MagSafe-3-Charger%2Fdp%2FB0G3PVNNNK%3Fref_%3Dast_bl_cpl_dp\">Prime 3-in-1 Charging Stand + UFO Foldable Charger</a> - $185.58, down from $319.98</li></ul>\r<br />\n<h3>SOLIX Portable Power Stations</h3>\r<br />\n<ul>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=53552&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ankersolix.com%2Fproducts%2Fc2000-gen2%3Fvariant%3D53152183189834%26ref%3Dblack-friday-pps_C2000%2520Gen%25202%2520Portable%2520Power%2520Station\">SOLIX C2000 Gen 2</a> - $849.99 ($350 off)</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=53552&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ankersolix.com%2Fproducts%2Ff3000%3Fvariant%3D52723634209098%26ref%3Dblack-friday-pps_img\">SOLIX F3000</a> - $1,699.99 ($200 off)</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=53552&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ankersolix.com%2Fproducts%2Fs5000-portable-power-station%3Fo_c%3D%26ref%3Dblack-friday-pps_img%26s_main%3DAS5101A1%26varId%3D67782784450950%26variant%3D67782784450950\">SOLIX S5000</a> - $2,499.99 ($1,100 off)</li></ul>\r<br />\n<h3>Portable Batteries</h3>\r<br />\n<ul>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=43469&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anker.com%2Fproducts%2Fa110b-anker-prime-20k-220w-power-bank%3Fvariant%3D45578450862230%26ref%3Dblack-friday-sale\">Anker Prime Power Bank (20K, 220W)</a> - $119.99, down from $179.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplin