ale\">Anker Prime Charger (160W, 3 Ports, Smart Display)</a> - $99.99, down from $149.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=43469&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anker.com%2Fproducts%2Fa83b6-anker-prime-charging-docking-station-14-in-1-dual-display-160w%3Fvariant%3D43931966734486%26ref%3Dblack-friday-sale\">Anker 14-in-1 Prime Charging Docking Station</a> - $161.49, down from $269.99</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=43469&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anker.com%2Fproducts%2Fbundle-a82b6-a88e2%3Fvariant%3D44809745531030%26ref%3Dblack-friday-sale\">Anker Prime Charging Docking Station</a> - $192.48, down from $299.98</li>\r<br />\n<li><a href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=J2shFQg6J/U&amp;mid=43469&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anker.com%2Fproducts%2Fa83b5-anker-prime-thunderbolt5-docking-station-14-in-1-140w-8k%3Fvariant%3D44920138268822%26ref%3Dblack-friday-sale\">Anker Prime TB5 Docking Station</a> - $309.99, down from $399.99</li></ul>\r<br />\n<h2>Sonos</h2>\r<br />\n<img src=\"/media/1c90a926c8f13476e17a9e8cff7f02698770868a120e81e63c55e3bea96ae02e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1406\" />\r<br />\n\r<br />\nSonos is back with its <a href=\"https://sonos.sjv.io/9LbVB3\">annual Black Friday sale</a>, with up to 25 percent off select products through November 30. This event includes savings on speakers, soundbars, headphones, subwoofers, and many more of the best Sonos audio accessories.\r<br />\n\r<br />\n<div><a href=\"https://sonos.sjv.io/9LbVB3\" target=\"_blank\"><div><div>UP TO 25% OFF</div>Sonos Black Friday Sale</div></a></div>\r<br />\n\r<br />\nHighlights from this event include the <a href=\"https://sonos.sjv.io/bkPGn9\">Sonos Ace for $229</a>, a $120 discount on the headphones. There are also quite a few soundbars on sale, ranging from the cheaper <a href=\"https://sonos.sjv.io/L0kqoa\">Ray for $169</a> ($50 off) to the high-end <a hr